>>
Rule 1 (tensor dtype index must be within supported range [0, 11])
{v_1 : tensor} |= 0 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 11
>>
Rule 2 (all dimensions are non-negative if the tensor has any axes)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : 0 ≤ shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 4 (either scalar or at least one dimension size is non-negative)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 0) ∨ ∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : 0 ≤ shape(v_1, i)
>>
Rule 5 (tensor dtype must not be the meta-type index 12)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≠ 12
